<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγή</span></b>  (A), 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγά</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱγ]</span>, ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽἄγνυμἰ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>breakage:</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>fragment, splinter,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαῖσι κωπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					425
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἁρμάτων τ᾽ ἀγαῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					693
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύματος ἀγή</span>
			<i>place where</i> the wave <i>breaks, beach,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.554
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.305a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>curve, bending,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφιος, ποταμον</span>
			= , <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				668
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				729
			</span></i> (v.l.):—hence Böckh cj. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγάν</span> (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγαν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.82
			</span></i>, in the sense of <i>crooked arts, deceit.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>wound,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
